2,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure the work can actually be finished on time. I'm curious about the firms and the site.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I'm more worried about the long-term bill. Who's going to pay for this beauty once the party's over?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I worry that beautiful drawings often hide a fragile reality. I want to see how things hold up.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about the human element. Who will actually be there every day to maintain the park?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's avoid picking a fantasy. I'm interested in how the land and the people actually behave, not how they look in a brochure.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, that's a good point. I hope we can find a plan that is both pretty and possible.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're too sweet. I just don't want to be the one explaining a budget hole in three years.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,We must be gentle with our resources and our land. I believe the past tells us the most honest stories.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Shizue. The history of maintenance is often more telling than the promise of a new design.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, exactly. I'll be looking at the actual usage and the drainage. Let's see if the plans survive a rainy Tuesday.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I think I know what I want to look at now. I want to see the firms and the depot notes.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I'll be digging into the money. I want to see the upkeep ledger and the groundskeeping roll.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the condition of previous works and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will examine the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I need to know who is available.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts. Let's get some real data.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
