30,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found out that only two firms are willing to do the big digging, and they are worried about the clay soil.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh, this is just lovely. The costs for greenery are skyrocketing, and we're losing our own staff. We're paying a premium for outsiders.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I am a bit saddened. It seems we have a habit of planting things and then forgetting to give them water.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@May, I noticed that too. The internal staff is shrinking. I wonder if we are relying too much on a few exhausted people.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"So, we have a heat-island effect and a drainage nightmare. I'm sure the architects have a ""creative"" solution that ignores both.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, does that mean the ground is really difficult? I'm worried the work will take much longer than they say.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! If the ground is a mess and the staff is gone, we're just buying a very expensive piece of art that will rot.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a shame. The eastern avenue is so bare now. We must choose a plan that values the life of the plant, not just the photo.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"If the staff is gone, we must look at the volunteers. But they are already stretched thin with other projects.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, it's not just difficult; it's being used as a shortcut to the tram. Any plan that puts a fancy hedge in the middle of that path is a failure.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just want us to be happy with the result. I hope the candidates have a way to handle the clay and the timing.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm not looking for ""happy,"" I'm looking for ""sustainable."" I can't support anything that looks like a money pit.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Let us be kind to the future. A simple plan that lasts is far more beautiful than a grand one that fades.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am worried that no matter which plan we pick, the people tasked with the daily care are already at their limit.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, that's why we need a plan that doesn't require a miracle to maintain. Let's see if any of these candidates are actually rational.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
